From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 04:39:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Anime folders: reject TMDb results that are not the anime
 AniList identified

TMDb returned confident nonsense for anime it does not know well
(KonoSuba matched to a DreamWorks title). In anime folders AniList now
says what the show is: TMDb TV results must be animation and match one
of its english / romaji / native titles (the japanese original name is
the strongest signal), otherwise they are rejected and TMDb is searched
again under the AniList titles. No match is better than a wrong one.
---
